---
export interface Props { alt?: boolean; }
const { alt = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class={alt ? 'sec-alt' : ''}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Teen step mein tutor</h2>
      <p>Sau profiles browse karne ki zarurat nahi. Requirement batayein, hum matching tutors laayenge.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps reveal">
      <div class="step">
        <h3>Requirement batayein</h3>
        <p>Class, subject, area, timing aur budget. Ya apne alfaaz mein likh dein — dono chalta hai.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <h3>Matching tutors dekhein</h3>
        <p>Hum aapke area ke suitable tutors shortlist karte hain, verification aur reviews ke saath.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <h3>Rabta karein</h3>
        <p>WhatsApp ya call par seedhi baat karein. Fee aur timing aap tutor se khud tay karein.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--space-3);counter-reset:s}
  @media(min-width:760px){.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
  .step{position:relative;padding-top:var(--space-2)}
  .step::before{counter-increment:s;content:counter(s);display:grid;place-items:center;
    width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;
    font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:19px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px}
  .step h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:600}
  .step p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted-fg);font-size:15.5px}
</style>
